# Incremental patch for the PARP Kconfig feature switches.
# Apply after source/overlay has been applied to the initial v4-parp tree.
#
# CONFIG_PARP_TIER2_WATERMARK gates the secondary memcg watermark code.
# CONFIG_PARP_RECLAIM_BIN_SCORE gates the app-prior/tier2 bin scorer.

